#: ../../pipeline.md:278
msgid ""
"The lid-rule script writes a JSON change log "
"(`lid_rule_changes_<timestamp>.json`) inside each scenario directory but "
"does **not** make a folder-level backup — recovery is via git. B1b makes "
"its own timestamped backup of the xlsx before writing."
msgstr ""
